@startuml offering-service-boundary
title Offering / Service Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Service" as S

O --> S : composes
O -[dotted]- S : is NOT
S -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 5:
  Offering composes Service. A Service is a constituent of an
  Offering, but an Offering is NOT a Service.
end note

@enduml
